skill-sql-query-plans	created: EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN indexed lookup; verified SEARCH + index name
skill-sqlite	created: build sqlite db from scratch + JOIN/GROUP BY aggregate; verifier re-queries
skill-sqlite-consistency-checks	created: PRAGMA integrity_check + foreign_key_check on seeded FK violation
skill-sqlite-page-format	created: parse db header bytes (page size @16-17, page count @28-31)
skill-sqlite-source-build	created: gcc-build sqlite3 CLI from shipped amalgamation (sqlite3.c/shell.c/h); functional query check
skill-sqlite-wal-format	created: parse WAL header/frame offsets from crafted deterministic -wal file
skill-ssh	created: openssh server via entrypoint; ssh client reads remote secret
skill-ssh-dropbear	created: dropbear server on :2222 via entrypoint; ssh client reads remote secret
skill-stan	created: pystan minimal normal model; posterior mu_mean within tolerance of 10.0
skill-state-tolerances	created: per-channel abs-diff tolerance check over reference/actual/tolerance JSON
skill-state-dict-shape-inference	created: infer Linear in/out from policy.pt state_dict tensor shapes (torch)
skill-static-binary-analysis	created: readelf/objdump/strings static analysis of ELF (elf, entry, secret)
skill-static-graph-inference	created: torch.jit.trace -> ScriptModule, verify static graph matches ref model
skill-statistical-testing	created: scipy ttest_ind + chi2_contingency; verifier recomputes
skill-stdin-stdout	created: stdin->stdout transform program; verifier runs with hidden input
skill-syscalls	created: strace read/write counts on compiled binary; verifier reruns strace
